experiments/campaign
# Campaign raw per-trial records ARE tracked (1.4 MB for both builds). They were previously
# excluded on the grounds that they regenerate identically from the committed seeds -- which is
# true, and was verified again in the 2026 revision when the full 6,000-trial campaign was re-run
# and every trial outcome reproduced. But "regenerates" is not "available": excluding them meant
# the campaign could not be re-analysed without re-running it, while the ablation and sensitivity
# raw records were tracked for exactly the opposite reason. Simulated peer review flagged the
# inconsistency and it is fixed.
# The ablation and sensitivity raw records ARE tracked: they are small (316K and 20K) and
# keeping the raw measurements, not just the aggregates, is part of the evidence rules.
!experiments/results/ablation.jsonl
!experiments/results/sensitivity.jsonl
__pycache__/
experiments/broker/run/
formal/*_TTrace_*.tla
formal/states/

# LaTeX pulls figures from docs/images/ and experiments/results/ via graphicspath.
# A copy left in paper/ shadows the real one and silently goes stale.
paper/*.pdf
!paper/manuscript.pdf
!paper/paper.pdf
!paper/supervisor_brief.pdf
!paper/fig_campaign.pdf
